Source code
-----------

The complete corresponding source code of every released version, including
the Dockerfile and all build scripts, is available at

  https://github.com/cccu-uku/oncocurve

under the Git tag of the same version (for example v1.0.0 for the Docker image
cccuuku/oncocurve:1.0.0). The images carry the source repository and the
commit they were built from in the labels org.opencontainers.image.source and
org.opencontainers.image.revision.


